                                "sense_id": "21742ab6-1fa4-3eb4-9042-cd5cf7e6d9e0",
                                "text": "De bakker draagt altijd ovenwanten om zichzelf te beschermen tegen de hoge temperaturen.",
                                "translation": "The baker always wears oven mitts to protect himself from the high temperatures.",
                                "english": "The baker always wears oven mitts to protect himself from the high temperatures."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "32f895dc-1e28-4dfc-9e89-4811ca8d87db",
                                "sense_id": "21742ab6-1fa4-3eb4-9042-cd5cf7e6d9e0",
                                "text": "Ze pakte de hete pan op met een kleine ovenwant.",
                                "translation": "She picked up the hot pan with a small pot holder.",
